[00:00.00] 作词 : David Wen Wei Liang
[00:00.00][by:马探花]
[00:01.00] 作曲 : David Wen Wei Liang
[00:18.26]You seem a little bit nervous
[00:18.26]你似乎有点紧张
[00:20.46]You sound a little uptight
[00:20.46]你的声音有点紧张
[00:22.86]You look a little bit jumpy
[00:22.86]你看上去有点紧张
[00:24.98]You sure you’re feeling alright?
[00:24.98]你确定你感觉好吗？
[00:27.39]You seem a little bit frazzled
[00:27.39]你似乎有点疲惫
[00:29.65]You look a little bit frayed
[00:29.65]你看上去有点紧张
[00:31.96]You act like this was on purpose
[00:31.96]你这样做是有目的的
[00:34.13]That’s just a masquerade
[00:34.13]这只是一个假面舞会
[00:36.32]Lie down (and throw your mind away)
[00:36.32]躺下（并扔掉你的想法）
[00:40.57]Cool off (it‘ll still be there tomorrow)
[00:40.57]凉快凉快（明天仍然会在那里）
[00:45.32]Stay in (forget about your day)
[00:45.32]呆在（忘了你的一天）
[00:49.92]Tune out (we’ll all be here tomorrow)
[00:49.92]调出（我们都会在这里）
[00:54.41]Exhale
[00:54.41]呼气
[01:13.30]If things seem a little too frantic
[01:13.30]如果事情看起来有点太疯狂
[01:14.96]And there’s no place you can turn
[01:14.96]而且没有你可以转弯的地方
[01:17.34]Just shut your mind, turn off your lights
[01:17.34]只要你闭上你的心，关掉你的灯
[01:19.54]To a point where life returns
[01:19.54]到一个生活回报的地步
[01:21.44]While chaos never ceases
[01:21.44]虽然混乱永远不会停止
[01:23.94]Confusion never dies
[01:23.94]混乱永远不会消逝
[01:26.24]You can put your stressful world on hold
[01:26.24]你可以把你的压力世界举行
[01:28.52]Just close your eyes
